# LSAN suppressions for the HIK C++ code - see Docs/Tooling.md.
# Only third-party noise and documented, intentional findings belong here.

# MVS SDK (every library under .../MVS/lib/, x86 and ARM): libMvCameraControl keeps ~32 KB of internal state (and objects of
# the transport-layer libraries it dlopen()s) alive until process exit. Not
# fixable on our side. Matching needs full stacks through the SDK, which has
# no frame pointers - hence fast_unwind_on_malloc=0 in ASAN_OPTIONS.
leak:/MVS/lib/
